---
import Site from "../layouts/Site.astro";
---
<Site title="Privacy">
  <article class="document">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>Feishin Remote connects only to the Feishin server address you enter. It has no accounts, analytics, advertising or tracking, and it sends nothing to the developer or any third party.</p>
    <p>The app stores saved server addresses, usernames and theme choices in its private app storage. Passwords are stored separately using Android Keystore encryption. Deleting a saved server removes its password, and uninstalling the app removes everything it stored.</p>
    <p>Feishin serves Remote over plain HTTP by default. Credentials and playback data sent that way can be seen by other devices on an untrusted network, so use a trusted network or an HTTPS/WSS connection you control.</p>
    <p>This site provides screenshots and a video of the app. Its hosting provider may collect information needed to serve the site.</p>
  </article>
</Site>
